WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.234 --> 00:00:02.702 line:0%
-All right now,
here's how it works.

00:00:02.702 --> 00:00:04.737 line:0%
Joel, you'll start the game by
pressing start on this buzzer.

00:00:04.737 --> 00:00:06.105 line:0%
It's the only button here.

00:00:06.105 --> 00:00:07.406 line:0%
[ Light laughter ]

00:00:07.406 --> 00:00:09.075 line:0%
And then, you draw a clue from
the top of the pile.

00:00:09.075 --> 00:00:10.643 line:0%
You have to get your teammate,
Michael,

00:00:10.643 --> 00:00:12.411 line:0%
to guess the clue as quickly
as possible.

00:00:12.411 --> 00:00:14.948 line:0%
Then hand the buzzer off to
the person on your right.

00:00:14.948 --> 00:00:16.382 line:0%
You can make any physical
gesture,

00:00:16.382 --> 00:00:17.550 line:0%
you can say whatever you want,

00:00:17.550 --> 00:00:19.953 line:0%
but you can't say any word in
the actual clue.

00:00:19.953 --> 00:00:22.122 line:0%
If you're holding the buzzer
when it goes off,

00:00:22.122 --> 00:00:23.522 line:0%
your team loses that round.

00:00:23.522 --> 00:00:24.591 line:0%
We're going to play three
rounds.

00:00:24.591 --> 00:00:25.991 line:0%
Joel, you're there.
-Okay.

00:00:25.991 --> 00:00:27.426 line:0%
-And Michael, you're over here,
offset.

00:00:27.426 --> 00:00:29.128 line:0%
Your across from me, buddy.
Dude, are you good at this?

00:00:29.128 --> 00:00:31.564 line:0%
-Yeah, let's get 'em.
-Whoo.

00:00:31.564 --> 00:00:33.599 line:0%
-This is tense.
-Whoo! Here we go.

00:00:33.599 --> 00:00:36.035 line:0%
All right, Joel, when you're
ready, press the button

00:00:36.035 --> 00:00:38.171 line:0%
and we will begin the game.
-Here we go.

00:00:38.171 --> 00:00:39.605 line:0%
-Mm-hmm.
-So I grab this --

00:00:39.605 --> 00:00:40.773 line:0%
at the same time I press
the button?

00:00:40.773 --> 00:00:42.342 line:0%
Yep, you're going.
-Oh, I'm going.

00:00:42.342 --> 00:00:43.843 line:0%
[ Beeping ]

00:00:43.843 --> 00:00:46.178 line:0%
This is what people wear on
their heads in Texas.

00:00:46.178 --> 00:00:47.480 line:0%
-Hats
Cowboy hat.

00:00:47.480 --> 00:00:49.048 line:0%
-Mm-hmm.
-Wait, that was great.

00:00:49.048 --> 00:00:50.683 line:0%
All right, good.
-Cheer!

00:00:50.683 --> 00:00:54.254 line:0%
[ Cheers ]

00:00:54.254 --> 00:00:56.089 line:0%
Shop top.

00:00:56.089 --> 00:00:57.790 line:0%
-Raindrop.
-Yeah!

00:00:57.790 --> 00:01:01.294 line:0%
-Yes!
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:01.294 --> 00:01:04.063 line:0%
-Oh, white girls wear this
to look like black girls?

00:01:04.063 --> 00:01:05.998 line:0%
-Bikini?
-Bikini?

00:01:05.998 --> 00:01:08.501 line:0%
-Don't guess. Don't guess.
You're on my team.

00:01:08.501 --> 00:01:10.736 line:0%
-Look like Trump did this a lot.

00:01:10.736 --> 00:01:12.805 line:0%
-Toner?
Spray tan, spray tan.

00:01:12.805 --> 00:01:14.941 line:0%
-There you go.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:14.941 --> 00:01:19.812 line:0%
-Uh -- if someone --
-Take your time.

00:01:19.812 --> 00:01:23.182 line:0%
-You're gonna need one to watch
the child when you --

00:01:23.182 --> 00:01:24.517 line:0%
-Babysitter.
-Yeah, that's right!

00:01:24.517 --> 00:01:26.052 line:0%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:26.052 --> 00:01:28.254 line:0%
-It's a thing, when you pierce
this.

00:01:28.254 --> 00:01:29.889 line:0%
-Your tongue?

00:01:29.889 --> 00:01:31.023 line:0%
Tongue ring!
-Yep.

00:01:31.023 --> 00:01:33.225 line:0%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:33.225 --> 00:01:36.195 line:0%
[ Buzzer ]
-Zombie!

00:01:36.195 --> 00:01:37.797 line:0%
If we got -- sleep walking?
-Yeah.

00:01:37.797 --> 00:01:39.165 line:0%
-Oh, man.
That was good.

00:01:39.165 --> 00:01:40.199 line:0%
All right, good.
All right.

00:01:40.199 --> 00:01:42.201 line:0%
Big deal. Big deal.
You got that one.

00:01:42.201 --> 00:01:43.536 line:0%
That's cool.
Congratulations.

00:01:43.536 --> 00:01:45.037 line:0%
And thanks so much for coming to
the show.

00:01:45.037 --> 00:01:46.339 line:0%
-What? That's --
[ Laughter ]

00:01:46.339 --> 00:01:47.473 line:0%
-You thought we were playing
another -- no, all right.

00:01:47.473 --> 00:01:48.941 line:0%
Let's go play another round.
Here we go.

00:01:48.941 --> 00:01:50.309 line:0%
-Let's go.
-All right.

00:01:50.309 --> 00:01:51.677 line:0%
All right.
-We can do this.

00:01:51.677 --> 00:01:53.179 line:0%
-Come on.
[ Beeping ]

00:01:53.179 --> 00:01:55.014 line:0%
-Okay. Um --

00:01:55.014 --> 00:01:57.316 line:0%
You can't eat it --
it's microwaveable.

00:01:57.316 --> 00:01:58.584 line:0%
-Burrito.
-Lunch!

00:01:58.584 --> 00:02:00.119 line:0%
Lunchtime.

00:02:00.119 --> 00:02:01.354 line:0%
-Tacos.
-There's a song.

00:02:01.354 --> 00:02:02.822 line:0%
-Pizza.
-♪ Something in the morning ♪

00:02:02.822 --> 00:02:03.823 line:0%
♪ Something in the evening ♪

00:02:03.823 --> 00:02:06.025 line:0%
♪ Something at supper time ♪

00:02:06.025 --> 00:02:08.127 line:0%
♪ When that -- on a something ♪

00:02:08.127 --> 00:02:09.428 line:0%
♪ You can have that any time ♪

00:02:09.428 --> 00:02:11.964 line:0%
-Bourbon?
-Oh, come on, man!

00:02:11.964 --> 00:02:13.933 line:0%
-Lemonade?
-It's Italian and Jewish.

00:02:13.933 --> 00:02:16.969 line:0%
Two good cuisines come together
and make beautiful harmony.

00:02:16.969 --> 00:02:18.404 line:0%
It's got a hole in the middle.

00:02:18.404 --> 00:02:19.838 line:0%
-A donut.
A bagel.

00:02:19.838 --> 00:02:22.474 line:0%
-Yeah, but what also --
-A pizza bagel?

00:02:22.474 --> 00:02:27.480 line:0%
-There you go!
[ Cheers ]

00:02:27.480 --> 00:02:28.481 line:0%
-Slow motion?
-Yes.

00:02:28.481 --> 00:02:30.716 line:0%
-Yes, sir!
[ Cheers ]

00:02:30.716 --> 00:02:34.187 line:0%
-This is something that you take
out -- plants you don't want

00:02:34.187 --> 00:02:37.056 line:0%
on your lawn -- and they grow.
-Weeds.

00:02:37.056 --> 00:02:38.858 line:0%
-Yeah, and what do you --
-Weed whacker!

00:02:38.858 --> 00:02:43.363 line:0%
-Yes!
[ Cheers ]

00:02:43.363 --> 00:02:45.197 line:0%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:45.197 --> 00:02:47.232 line:0%
[ Buzzer ]
-You're choking!

00:02:47.232 --> 00:02:49.202 line:0%
-Why were you choking yourself?
-He choked on that.

00:02:49.202 --> 00:02:50.336 line:0%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:50.336 --> 00:02:52.472 line:0%
-He choked on that.
-I couldn't say it. I --

00:02:52.472 --> 00:02:54.707 line:0%
-He choked on that one.
-Yeah, yeah.

00:02:54.707 --> 00:02:56.308 line:0%
-All right, here we go.
Last round, good luck.

00:02:56.308 --> 00:02:57.309 line:0%
-Ready?
-Yeah.

00:02:57.309 --> 00:02:59.645 line:0%
-All right.
[ Beeping ]

00:02:59.645 --> 00:03:02.915 line:0%
-Oh, okay.
You do this at a bar.

00:03:02.915 --> 00:03:04.951 line:0%
Oh, oh, oh, oh, oh!
-Like --

00:03:04.951 --> 00:03:07.487 line:0%
-"Stairway to Heaven," there's
a real long one in

00:03:07.487 --> 00:03:10.222 line:0%
"Stairway to Heaven."
In rock songs.

00:03:10.222 --> 00:03:13.292 line:0%
And that's how they show off.
-Guitar solo?

00:03:13.292 --> 00:03:15.561 line:0%
-There you go.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:15.561 --> 00:03:17.163 line:0%
-Do this in bars?
-I don't know.

00:03:17.163 --> 00:03:20.065 line:0%
-Okay, this is something you
don't really want anyone taking

00:03:20.065 --> 00:03:24.737 line:0%
a picture of you eating.
It's a -- it's on a stick.

00:03:24.737 --> 00:03:26.071 line:0%
-Corndog, corndog.
-Yeah, that's right!

00:03:26.071 --> 00:03:27.072 line:0%
[ Cheers and applause ]
-Yes, sir!

00:03:27.072 --> 00:03:28.574 line:0%
-That's exactly it!
-Yes, sir!

00:03:28.574 --> 00:03:31.644 line:0%
-This is the guy that will walk
up behind you and rob you

00:03:31.644 --> 00:03:33.079 line:0%
and you don't even know it.

00:03:33.079 --> 00:03:36.115 line:0%
-Me.
[ Laughter ]

00:03:36.115 --> 00:03:37.616 line:0%
Pickpocket! Pickpocket!
-Yes!

00:03:37.616 --> 00:03:38.784 line:0%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:03:38.784 --> 00:03:40.052 line:0%
-Me.

00:03:40.052 --> 00:03:41.387 line:0%
[ Buzzer ]

00:03:41.387 --> 00:03:42.921 line:0%
We lost that one.
You guys win.

00:03:42.921 --> 00:03:44.056 line:0%
The champs, but it's all right.

00:03:44.056 --> 00:03:48.261 line:0%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:48.261 --> 00:03:49.962 line:0%
Our thanks to Joel McHale,
Michael Che.

00:03:49.962 --> 00:03:51.898 line:0%
-In your face!
-In my face right there.

00:03:51.898 --> 00:03:54.267 line:0%
Offset!
And we'll get it next time.

